msgid "Package health has not been checked yet."
msgstr ""

#: src/ubuntu_start.py:1073
msgid "Check package health"
msgstr ""

#: src/ubuntu_start.py:1090
msgid "Storage"
msgstr ""

#: src/ubuntu_start.py:1091
msgid ""
"Local filesystem capacity and, when Linux reports it, available file "
"entries. A filesystem can run out of file entries even while byte space "
"remains. A separate home filesystem is shown when your personal files use a "
"different mounted volume."
msgstr ""

#: src/ubuntu_start.py:1099
msgid "Backup app availability"
msgstr ""

#: src/ubuntu_start.py:1100
msgid ""
"Check locally whether Ubuntu’s Déjà Dup Backups app is installed. This does "
"not inspect your files, backup destinations or backup history."
