msgid "Battery"
msgstr ""

#: src/ubuntu_start.py:1123
msgid ""
"Charge level, charging state, reported battery health, cycle count, any "
"charge limit exposed by the battery, and the active power profile are read "
"from local system information when available. An estimated capacity compared "
"with the original design is shown only if the battery exposes both values. "
"Battery health algorithms vary by manufacturer, so reported values are not "
"directly comparable. These readings are informational, not universal service "
"thresholds. Ubuntu Start does not change charge limits or power settings."
msgstr ""

